gyi(){return"Uses your phone's GPS. Carry it with you (pocket, armband or hand) and run outdoors: distance is measured automatically and the run ends when you reach the goal. It keeps measuring with the screen off; you'll see a notification meanwhile. Indoors or between tall buildings the signal is weaker and may undercount."},
